ausi, sähköpostit ja tunnukset. Napautus kopioi kentän.\n\nJokainen tieto kantaa mukanaan tilansa: lukittu, valittu, odottaa vai ei varmistettu. Arvio ei näytä faktalta — kyseenalainen puhelinnumero kantaa varauksensa, ja Y-tunnus odottaa kunnes PRH antaa sen.\n\nSovellus ei tee kirjanpitoa. Se kertoo mikä puuttuu."}, "icon": {"en-US": {"name": "/com.longshore.mycompany/en-US/icon_5J_JI9vrnL6xdD-cGw3gihFCFLGVNptteCKCE2VR2fo=.png", "sha256": "e49fc923dbeb9cbeb1743f9c1b0de08a114214b195369b6d782282136551d9fa", "size": 30309}}, "preferredSigner": "c6a5793f6093935f5376c87ccfc433fa594b297b772331c713e3670d2458204e"}, "versions": {"6b24890fca3efd17baa62efc31195418b8076726be102bba2b7d58ed218440e4": {"added": 1786014981000, "file": {"name": "/com.longshore.mycompany_10001.apk", "sha256": "6b24890fca3efd17baa62efc31195418b8076726be102bba2b7d58ed218440e4", "size": 3025406}, "manifest": {"versionName": "1.0.1", "versionCode": 10001, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 22, "targetSdkVersion": 34}, "signer": {"sha256": ["c6a5793f6093935f5376c87ccfc433fa594b297b772331c713e3670d2458204e"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "com.longshore.mycompany.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}, "698664a1844b3614a947a0169be959fd00e7f1631ea8fb2dc2ec7794aae4e84a": {"added": 1786004248000, "file": {"name": "/com.longshore.mycompany_10000.apk", "sha256": "698664a1844b3614a947a0169be959fd00e7f1631ea8fb2dc2ec7794aae4e84a", "size": 3024245}, "manifest": {"versionName": "1.0.0", "versionCode": 10000, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 22, "targetSdkVersion": 34}, "signer": {"sha256": ["c6a5793f6093935f5376c87ccfc433fa594b297b772331c713e3670d2458204e"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "com.longshore.mycompany.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}]}}}}, "com.longshore.mysphere": {"metadata": {"added": 1786003109000, "lastUpdated": 1786015683000}, "versions": {"0d1c14de241183a68a90c2923107d2ed6131c714f469f5eaa3ed87b87e676c75": nul